MathScope.M1.Arithmetic.pi_hundred : (MathScope.M1.Arithmetic.primesIn 2 100).card = 25
'MathScope.M1.Arithmetic.pi_hundred' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
